WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.055 --> 00:00:06.618
"You're funny, Tiny!" Lucy said.

2
00:00:06.619 --> 00:00:11.754
Ringo frowned. "We thought you crashed."

3
00:00:11.755 --> 00:00:15.617
"We landed before the sandstorm," Lucy said.

4
00:00:15.618 --> 00:00:22.950
"I guess the storm buried our ship."

5
00:00:22.951 --> 00:00:26.927
PJ cleaned off the ship.

6
00:00:26.928 --> 00:00:30.065
Lucy told Ringo about the mission.

7
00:00:30.066 --> 00:00:33.288
"A whale turtle must get to the sea.

8
00:00:33.289 --> 00:00:36.736
But it won't follow me."

9
00:00:36.737 --> 00:00:40.745
"It just keeps eating sand," PJ said.

10
00:00:40.746 --> 00:00:43.022
"Bot," Ringo said.

11
00:00:43.023 --> 00:00:46.502
"Do you know anything about whale turtles?"

12
00:00:46.503 --> 00:00:48.881
Bot nodded.

13
00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:52.868
"They have bad eyes and good noses.

14
00:00:52.869 --> 00:00:57.303
They live mostly in the water.

15
00:00:57.304 --> 00:01:01.939
But they like to eat fruit on land."

16
00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:03.932
Ringo nodded.

17
00:01:03.933 --> 00:01:07.921
"Lucy, did you pick up the turtle?"

18
00:01:07.922 --> 00:01:26.311
"No." Lucy laughed. "I'll show you."

19
00:01:26.312 --> 00:01:40.245
They flew off.

20
00:01:40.246 --> 00:01:51.284
"Wow!" Ringo said. "It's big!"

21
00:01:51.285 --> 00:01:54.703
"We need to move it," Lucy said.

22
00:01:54.704 --> 00:01:58.832
"Without water it could die."

23
00:01:58.833 --> 00:02:05.248
Ringo saw the clamor birds' boomberries.

24
00:02:05.249 --> 00:02:09.007
"I have an idea," he said.

25
00:02:09.008 --> 00:02:15.813
Bot flew slowly past the turtle's head.

26
00:02:15.814 --> 00:02:18.690
Ringo opened a hatch.

27
00:02:18.691 --> 00:02:22.132
The whale turtle sniffed at the ship.

28
00:02:22.133 --> 00:02:25.070
Then . . . Snap!

29
00:02:25.071 --> 00:02:28.771
It tried to bite the spaceship!

